@base <http://www.semanticweb.org/lixiangcheng/CASK+CRO-abox#> .

<http://www.semanticweb.org/lixiangcheng/CASK+CRO-abox> rdf:type owl:Ontology ;
                                                         owl:imports <http://www.w3id.org/hsu-aut/cask/3.0.1> ;
                                                         rdfs:comment "IOC conversion supplement only. Existing launch, motion, ABox and runtime World Model are unchanged. Initial poses, task states, declared defaults and launch overrides have distinct records. Do not interpret this snapshot as live state." .

